debian-config-server-hardening (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial development release of debian-config-server-hardening package.
  * Add 60-server-hardening.conf for strict sysctl network stack and execution
    controls.
  * Depend on debian-config-system-hardening base package.
  * Add postinst logic to enforce multi-user target and safely disable unneeded
    server daemons (exim4, cups, avahi-daemon).
  * Implement robust fstab hardening for temporary storage (noexec, nosuid,
    nodev) and /proc (hidepid=2) with clean remove/purge lifecycle separation.
    (Closes: #100000)

